# Craterhoof Behemoth, ruling 2025-04-04: its ability "affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you
# begin to control later in the turn won't gain trample and get +X/+X." Turn 1 Bot1 plays a Forest and casts five Moxen and a
# Black Lotus; turn 3 it draws Llanowar Elves and holds it; turn 5 it draws and casts the Behemoth (Moxen and Lotus), alone: X is 1,
# so it is a 6/6 with haste and trample and hits Bot2 for 6. Afterwards it casts Llanowar Elves with the Forest: a plain
# 1/1, with neither trample nor a bonus.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Craterhoof Behemoth
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

